      "id": "claim_1e5ab7e3c22045828010402038b87419",
      "statement": "The digichat Cloudflare Container (Dockerfile.digichat-cloudflare, Node.js 22) hosts the digichat Next.js BFF behind a Worker on digithings.ai. One shared Container instance (id shared-v7) serves all marketing tenants (digithings, OCC, digiquant dashboard) differentiated at request time via ?host= / X-Embed-Host and the DIGICHAT_EMBED_TENANTS registry secret. The Worker owns paths /embed*, /api/chat*, /api/embed*, /api/byok*, /api/plan-proof*, /api/health, and /_dtchat*; Pages owns /chat and /chat/occ shells.",
