      "id": "claim_068255326d3e4102a102139a00758ec6",
      "statement": "The digithings-cron dispatch function sends POST requests to the GitHub Actions API, treating 200/204 as success and 422 with 'already queued'/'already running' as benign. Rate limits (429, 403/422 with rate-limit text) trigger up to 3 retries with Retry-After-aware backoff. DRY_RUN=1 logs the intended POST without calling GitHub. GH_DISPATCH_TOKEN is required for real dispatch.",
