      "id": "claim_3c188f191f4b4c2cad35baaa860949b1",
      "statement": "Both the digichat Container (DigiChatContainer) and stack Container (DigiStackContainer) use sleepAfter='3m' — after 3 minutes of idle the Firecracker microVM suspends, with each wake billing for the full window. The stack Worker's fetch() performs per-request port waiting with a 180-second portReadyTimeout and returns 503 when the container fails to become ready. Bumping the shared container ID (shared-v7 → shared-v8 for digichat, shared-v15 → shared-v16 for stack) forces a new Firecracker instance on next deploy.",
