      "id": "claim_213c23618a0d41c390caa980f657d7d9",
      "statement": "The digiquant-mcp Container is a dedicated single-replica Container (DigiQuantMcpContainer, max_instances=1, id mcp-v1, Dockerfile: digiquant/Dockerfile.mcp) serving FastMCP streamable-http on :8767 with default read-only scope. The mcp.digithings.ai custom-domain route is commented out in wrangler.toml behind a HUMAN GATE pending Worker-edge digikey JWT enforcement (scope digiquant:backtest). A cold start pays only the FastMCP import — R2 is the market-data cache, refreshed by a separate daily cron.",
